"name":"श्री कुंभनदास, श्री कुम्भनदास","hinglishName":"shri kunbhanadas, shri kumbhanadasa","slug":"shri-kunbhanadas-shri-kumbhanadasa","biography":"","metadata":null,"imageUrl":null,"verses":[{"id":"local-308","title":"महारानी श्री राधिका अष्ट सखियन के झुंड","category":"Shloka","sanskrit_text":"महारानी श्री राधिका अष्ट सखियन के झुंड।","hindi_text":"जहाँ जहाँ महारानी श्री राधारानी और उनकी अष्ट सखियाँ चरण रखती हैं, श्री कृष्ण उस भूमि को पहले बुहरात (झाड़ू) लगाते हैं। ऐसी भूमि श्री राधा कुंड की जय हो, जय हो।","english_text":null,"english_translation":"Wherever the Queen of all the Queens Shri Radhika and her 8 main Sakhis (Asta Sakhis) keeps their lotus feet on the ground, there, first, Shri Krishn sweeps that land. O, All Glories to Shri Radha’s lake “Radha Kunda”.","description":"https://www.brajrasik.org/hi/articles/5db55bc3f1e91600607aba47/maharani-shri-radhika-asht-sakhiyan-ke-jhund-shri-kumbhandas","author":"श्री कुंभनदास, श्री कुम्भनदास जी की वाणी","status":"published","content_text":"महारानी श्री राधिका अष्ट सखियन के झुंड।\nडगर बुहारत साँवरौ जय जय राधा कुंड॥\n- श्री कुंभनदास, श्री कुम्भनदास जी की वाणी\nजहाँ जहाँ महारानी श्री राधारानी और उनकी अष्ट सखियाँ चरण रखती हैं, श्री कृष्ण उस भूमि को पहले बुहरात (झाड़ू) लगाते हैं। ऐसी भूमि श्री राधा कुंड की जय हो, जय हो।","tags":["Braj Rasik","Mass Import"],"image_urls":[],"video_urls":[],"media_links":[],"source_url":"https://www.brajrasik.org/hi/articles/5db55bc3f1e91600607aba47/maharani-shri-radhika-asht-sakhiyan-ke-jhund-shri-kumbhandas","slug":"maharani-shri-radhika-asht-sakhiyan-ke-jhunda"}],"books":[],"rawItem":null}}]}]],null],null],null]},[null,["$","$L5",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","saints","children","$6","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L7",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":"$undefined","notFoundStyles":"$undefined"}]],null]},[null,["$","$L5",null,{"parallel